1
00:00:06,10 --> 00:00:07,76
Wow. That ripped.
它會扯破衣服

2
00:00:09,74 --> 00:00:11,47
That ripped real nice!
一點也不含糊

3
00:00:12,24 --> 00:00:16,40
How many times do I have to tell you? You turn and slide.
你要我說幾次？要側身滑出來

4
00:00:16,71 --> 00:00:18,08
Turn and slide.
側身滑出來

5
00:00:18,28 --> 00:00:19,97
You don't turn and slide.
不是側身滑出來

6
00:00:20,18 --> 00:00:21,91
You throw it out!
是把它扔出去

7
00:00:23,65 --> 00:00:26,35
I get tetanus shots every time I get dressed!
我每次穿衣服 都得打破傷風預防針

8
00:00:26,55 --> 00:00:30,65
We're not throwing it out. I built it with my own hands!
不能扔掉，這是我親手釘的

9
00:00:32,09 --> 00:00:33,92
How about we sell it?
好，那賣掉呢？

10
00:00:35,80 --> 00:00:37,09
All right.
好吧

11
00:00:38,40 --> 00:00:40,39
But you'll have to tell them.
不過你得告訴它們

12
00:00:44,44 --> 00:00:48,31
Can we stick you in another cabinet? They seem all right with it!
你們可以搬個家嗎？ 看來它們沒意見

13
00:00:49,61 --> 00:00:51,48
The One with the Cat
本集播出：「靈貓」

00:00:54,61 --> 00:00:56,48
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

14
00:01:36,99 --> 00:01:39,26
Hey,why did the chicken fall out of the tree?
雞為什麼不會從樹下掉下來？ 

15
00:01:39,39 --> 00:01:40,38
Why?
為什麼？

16
00:01:40,56 --> 00:01:43,53
Because you have doody on your head.
因為頭上有翅膀

17
00:01:44,97 --> 00:01:47,94
Yeah,it was funnier when Ben told it.
班說就很好笑

18
00:01:51,27 --> 00:01:53,14
Hey,Monica. It's Chip.
摩妮卡，我是奇普 漂亮！

19
00:01:53,94 --> 00:01:54,93
Who's Chip?
誰是奇普？

20
00:01:55,21 --> 00:01:57,61
It was good running into you today.
很高興今天遇見你

21
00:01:57,81 --> 00:02:00,80
My number is 555-9323. Give me a call.
我的電話是5559323 打給我，就這樣

22
00:02:01,05 --> 00:02:03,38
"Chip" is Chip Matthews.
奇普就是奇普馬修斯

23
00:02:03,99 --> 00:02:07,32
The guy who took Rachel to the prom? Why's he calling you?
瑞秋的高中舞會舞伴？ 他打給你幹什麼？

24
00:02:07,56 --> 00:02:11,46
Because I ran into him at the bank. He is still so cute.
我在銀行遇見他，他還是好帥

26
00:02:11,66 --> 00:02:15,62
You're so lucky! He's like the most popular guy in school!
你好幸運 他是全校最紅的男生

27
00:02:16,40 --> 00:02:17,73
I know!
我知道

28
00:02:20,34 --> 00:02:22,33
Chip? Hi,it's Monica.
奇普？我是摩妮卡

29
00:02:24,31 --> 00:02:27,37
好…好

30
00:02:29,21 --> 00:02:30,40
好

31
00:02:32,58 --> 00:02:35,91
Oh,my God! We just had the best conversation!
好，再見 天哪，我們聊得好愉快

33
00:02:41,96 --> 00:02:43,12
I was just leaving.
我正要走

34
00:02:43,42 --> 00:02:44,65
Good.
好

35
00:02:44,93 --> 00:02:46,69
I've got a report to read.
我要看報告

36
00:02:46,96 --> 00:02:50,62
It's eight pages. I hope I don't fall asleep.
有八頁，但願我不會睡著

37
00:02:50,97 --> 00:02:52,33
Why? Did you write it?
為什麼？是你寫的？

38
00:02:57,34 --> 00:02:58,83
Look at that!
你看看

39
00:02:59,11 --> 00:03:02,04
Chip Matthews called. I wonder what he wants.
奇普馬修斯打電話來 不曉得有什麼事

40
00:03:03,68 --> 00:03:05,15
Well,actually....
其實…

41
00:03:05,35 --> 00:03:09,87
I bet he sensed that I was ready to have sex with another guy.
他一定感應到 我可以跟別的男人上床了

42
00:03:17,03 --> 00:03:19,39
Why don't you give him a call?
那你何不打給他？

43
00:03:26,40 --> 00:03:27,39
好啊

44
00:03:31,97 --> 00:03:35,03
-Are you sure you want to hear this? -I'm sure.
你真的想聽？ 真的

45
00:03:37,05 --> 00:03:39,41
Chip! Hi,it's Rachel.
奇普，我是瑞秋

46
00:03:40,52 --> 00:03:42,35
Rachel Greene.
瑞秋葛林

47
00:03:42,55 --> 00:03:45,04
You left me a message?
你留言給我？

48
00:03:47,26 --> 00:03:49,66
Yes,you did. My roommate wrote it down.
你有，我的室友記下來了

49
00:03:51,16 --> 00:03:52,99
Monica Geller?
摩妮卡蓋勒？

50
00:03:59,03 --> 00:04:01,37
Oh,that's right!
原來如此

51
00:04:03,57 --> 00:04:06,84
He called to ask out Monica.
他是要約摩妮卡

52
00:04:07,88 --> 00:04:10,90
That's got to be embarrassing.
真是尷尬

53
00:04:15,95 --> 00:04:18,68
Dumb drunken bitch
醉醺醺的白癡賤人

54
00:04:23,12 --> 00:04:24,11
Thank you!
謝謝

55
00:04:27,63 --> 00:04:28,93
Here's a question.
請問一下

56
00:04:29,20 --> 00:04:32,53
Where'd you get the "finest oak east of the Mississippi"?
密西西比以東 最好的橡木傢俱在哪裡？

57
00:04:32,70 --> 00:04:36,36
First tell us where you got the prettiest lace in the land.
你先說 全國最漂亮的蕾絲在哪裡

58
00:04:37,21 --> 00:04:38,30
It's your ad.
這是你們的廣告

59
00:04:38,54 --> 00:04:40,13
Looks good?
不賴吧？

60
00:04:40,98 --> 00:04:44,71
"Stunning entertainment center,fine
「高級視聽娛樂櫃，精緻…」

61
00:04:45,75 --> 00:04:48,38
Fine ltalian craftsmanship."
「精緻意大利手工」

62
00:04:49,92 --> 00:04:52,55
You're selling the entertainment center?
天哪，你們要賣娛樂櫃？

63
00:04:52,82 --> 00:04:54,15
Why? I love it.
為什麼？我喜歡那個櫃子

64
00:04:54,36 --> 00:04:56,19
-You want it? -No.
你們要嗎？ 不要

66
00:04:58,03 --> 00:04:59,36
Gepetto?
「名家手藝」？

67
00:05:01,16 --> 00:05:03,19
Five thousand dollars?
「定價5千」？

68
00:05:03,40 --> 00:05:05,06
Are you insane?
你瘋了嗎？

69
00:05:05,37 --> 00:05:08,03
The ad alone cost $300.
登廣告就要3百

70
00:05:08,50 --> 00:05:12,03
I'm changing it to $50 or your best offer.
我要改成50元或再議

71
00:05:13,88 --> 00:05:17,90
What kind of profit is that? And you call yourself an accountant?
那有什麼利潤可言？ 你也配當會計師？

72
00:05:20,18 --> 00:05:21,15
我不是

73
00:05:26,79 --> 00:05:28,26
What do you do?
那你是什麼？

74
00:05:29,76 --> 00:05:31,92
I can't believe you don't know.
你居然不知道我幹哪一行

75
00:05:32,26 --> 00:05:33,85
I actually don't know.
我也不知道 是不是什麼…

76
00:05:37,10 --> 00:05:39,53
Oh,my God,no! Shoo,kitty!
天哪，不要，走開 不要…

77
00:05:41,70 --> 00:05:43,64
There's a kitty in my guitar case.
阿甘，我的吉他盒裡有一隻貓

78
00:05:43,81 --> 00:05:46,87
Everyone's gonna want one.
噓…其他人都想要

79
00:05:49,01 --> 00:05:50,27
Come on,you!
給我過來

80
00:05:51,15 --> 00:05:52,64
Crazy!
真是的

81
00:05:53,11 --> 00:05:55,64
-Oh,my God! -What?
天哪 什麼？

82
00:05:55,78 --> 00:05:57,61
Nothing.
沒事

84
00:05:57,79 --> 00:05:59,18
What's wrong?
怎麼了？

86
00:06:02,66 --> 00:06:07,32
I just have this really strong feeling that this cat is my mother.
我只是有一股強烈的感覺 這隻貓是我媽

87
00:06:08,06 --> 00:06:11,36
The mom you met in Montauk? She was a cat?
莫陶克那個媽媽？ 她是一隻貓？

89
00:06:12,50 --> 00:06:16,49
That makes the fact that she owns beach-front property all the more impressive.
而她居然擁有濱海小屋

90
00:06:16,74 --> 00:06:18,90
No. She was a human lady.
不，她是一個人

91
00:06:19,14 --> 00:06:22,80
This is the spirit of my mom,Lilly. The one that killed herself.
這是莉莉媽媽的靈魂 自殺的那個

92
00:06:23,01 --> 00:06:27,64
Have you been taking your grandmother's glaucoma medicine again?
是她變成一隻貓 還是你又偷吃外婆的青光眼藥

93
00:06:28,35 --> 00:06:30,41
No,Dr. Skeptismo.
沒有，疑心病博士

94
00:06:31,65 --> 00:06:35,05
I'm sure. First of all,there's the feeling.
我很肯定 第一，我有這個感覺

95
00:06:36,82 --> 00:06:40,56
And for another, she went into my guitar case...
還有，她跑進我的吉他盒裡

96
00:06:40,86 --> 00:06:43,16
...which is lined with orange felt.
它的襯裡是橘色的

97
00:06:45,77 --> 00:06:49,23
My mother's favorite fish was orange roughy.
我媽最喜歡的魚是橘棘鯛

98
00:06:53,04 --> 00:06:55,34
Cats like fish.
貓喜歡吃魚

99
00:06:58,15 --> 00:07:01,17
You had me with orange felt.
聽到橘色襯裡我就信了

100
00:07:02,32 --> 00:07:03,87
Hi,Mommy!
媽

101
00:07:06,22 --> 00:07:09,55
I haven't seen this smile in 17 years.
我17年沒看到這個笑容了

102
00:07:11,96 --> 00:07:15,40
-Phoebe's mom's got a huge pair of -Let it go!
菲比的媽有兩顆好大的… 算了吧

103
00:07:20,97 --> 00:07:24,23
When were you going to tell me that you're dating Chip?
你什麼時候要告訴我 你要跟奇普約會？

104
00:07:25,01 --> 00:07:26,00
Now?
現在？

105
00:07:28,01 --> 00:07:29,67
Can I go out with him?
我跟他約會沒關係吧？

106
00:07:29,91 --> 00:07:34,68
No. I can't believe you'd want to after what he did to me.
當然有關係 他那樣對我耶

107
00:07:34,92 --> 00:07:36,32
That thing at the prom?
你是說舞會的事？

108
00:07:36,52 --> 00:07:41,25
I couldn't find him for hours! He was having sex with Amy Welsh!
摩妮卡，我2個小時找不到他 他跑去跟艾美威許做愛

109
00:07:42,66 --> 00:07:45,89
That was in high school. How can it still bother you?
那是高中的事 你怎麼還會在意？

110
00:07:46,06 --> 00:07:50,59
Oh,yeah,you're right,Moni-cow.
說得也是，莫母豬

111
00:07:51,57 --> 00:07:53,80
Okay,I hear you.
我懂了

112
00:07:53,97 --> 00:07:57,17
Why do you have to go out with Chip?
你為什麼偏要跟奇普約會？

113
00:07:57,34 --> 00:07:59,03
We went to different schools.
我們的高中不一樣

114
00:07:59,31 --> 00:08:01,71
We went to the same school.
少來，我們上同一所高中

115
00:08:02,34 --> 00:08:04,44
You went to one where you were popular.
你在高中是風雲人物

116
00:08:04,65 --> 00:08:08,78
You rode on Chip's motorcycle and wore his letterman jacket.
你坐奇普的摩托車 穿他的特優選手外套

117
00:08:08,98 --> 00:08:13,18
I went to one where I wore a band uniform that was specially made.
我穿的是特製的樂隊制服

118
00:08:15,06 --> 00:08:17,02
They had that specially made?
那是特製的？

119
00:08:19,49 --> 00:08:21,55
It was a Home Ec project.
那是家政課的作業之一

120
00:08:23,56 --> 00:08:27,00
Oh,my God! They said it was for the mascot.
天哪 他們說那是給吉祥物穿的

121
00:08:29,87 --> 00:08:34,64
Back then I thought that I'd never get to go out with a Chip Matthews.
那時候我以為 我永遠不可能跟奇普約會

122
00:08:34,84 --> 00:08:37,54
Now he's called me up and asked me out.
現在他打來約我

123
00:08:37,88 --> 00:08:42,01
The fat girl inside me really wants to go. I owe her this.
我心中那個胖女孩真的很想去 這是我欠她的

124
00:08:42,22 --> 00:08:43,98
I never let her eat.
我從不讓她盡情的吃

125
00:08:44,92 --> 00:08:47,89
-You go out with him. -Really?
你去吧 真的？

126
00:08:48,76 --> 00:08:53,09
If possible,could you leave him and have sex with another guy?
如果可以，你能不能丟下他 去跟別人做愛？

127
00:08:53,39 --> 00:08:54,42
I'll try.
我試試看

128
00:08:58,33 --> 00:09:01,43
Any luck getting rid of the entertainment center?
娛樂櫃賣得怎樣？

129
00:09:01,60 --> 00:09:05,66
There were a couple calls, but they won't work out.
昨晚有幾通詢問電話 但我都覺得不可行

130
00:09:05,87 --> 00:09:09,07
Joey has a very careful screening process.
喬伊有一套嚴格的篩選過程

131
00:09:09,84 --> 00:09:14,11
Not everyone is qualified to own wood and nails.
並非每個人都適合擁有木製品

132
00:09:14,35 --> 00:09:15,94
Stop it!
別掙扎了

133
00:09:16,18 --> 00:09:20,95
She keeps trying to get away. Just like when she was alive.
她一直想跑走 跟在世時一樣

134
00:09:22,79 --> 00:09:25,55
How long is your mom going to be with us?
你媽要跟我們在一起多久？

135
00:09:25,79 --> 00:09:27,39
I'm not sure.
我不確定

136
00:09:27,60 --> 00:09:31,40
I guess until she gets used to the fact that there's...
直到她能接受我有了…

137
00:09:31,63 --> 00:09:32,93
...a new mom.
新媽媽吧

138
00:09:34,80 --> 00:09:37,86
Now she's worried that she'll be replaced.
她很擔心會被取代

139
00:09:38,27 --> 00:09:40,76
That's not going to happen,is it?
才不會呢，對不對？

140
00:09:42,14 --> 00:09:43,70
I have to go make a call.
我去房裡回個電話

141
00:09:43,95 --> 00:09:45,64
Why not use this phone?
怎麼不在這裡打？

142
00:09:45,88 --> 00:09:50,37
I'm returning a call from a certain mom at the B-E-A-C-H.
我要打給住在（海邊）的媽媽

143
00:09:50,65 --> 00:09:53,31
I just spelled the wrong word.
我說反了

144
00:09:54,26 --> 00:09:57,52
Anyway,I don't want to do it in front of someone with a tail.
我不想在有尾巴的人面前打

145
00:09:57,69 --> 00:10:00,59
Hey,you swore you would never tell.
你發誓不說的

146
00:10:02,53 --> 00:10:07,66
So am I crazy,or does Phoebe's mom remind anyone else of a cat?
是我瘋了，還是有人也覺得 菲比的媽像一隻貓？

147
00:10:09,44 --> 00:10:11,43
Ross,don't start.
羅斯，別提了 拜託

148
00:10:11,84 --> 00:10:15,97
You actually believe there's a woman inside that cat?
你們真的相信 那隻貓是一個女人變的？

149
00:10:16,68 --> 00:10:18,11
I believe it.
我相信

150
00:10:19,78 --> 00:10:20,77
No,you don't.
你才不信

151
00:10:21,02 --> 00:10:22,00
Yes,I do.
我信

152
00:10:22,22 --> 00:10:23,51
No,you
你才不…

153
00:10:25,02 --> 00:10:26,45
You know what?
你知道嗎？

154
00:10:27,29 --> 00:10:29,19
You won't suck me into this.
我不會跟你爭辯

155
00:10:29,39 --> 00:10:33,49
Sure I will. Because you always have to be right.
你會 你總是要說服別人

156
00:10:33,79 --> 00:10:36,92
I do not always have Okay,okay.
我才沒有… 好

157
00:10:39,77 --> 00:10:41,60
Jurassic Park could happen.
「侏羅紀公園」是有可能的

158
00:10:47,27 --> 00:10:52,18
And you know what? Actually, I do think Kirk was smarter than Spock.
還有 我覺得蟑螂比恐龍聰明

159
00:11:00,35 --> 00:11:03,69
You were kidding about the Kirk-Spock-thing,though,right?
剛才那句是開玩笑吧？

160
00:11:08,00 --> 00:11:10,19
That's pretty nice.
還不賴嘛

161
00:11:10,46 --> 00:11:12,13
"Pretty nice"?
還不賴？

162
00:11:12,73 --> 00:11:15,40
Pardon my roommate. He wanted to marry this.
原諒我的室友 他簡直想娶它過門

163
00:11:16,54 --> 00:11:19,84
We don't have $50. But would you trade for it?
我們沒有50塊錢 你們願意交換嗎？

164
00:11:20,07 --> 00:11:21,20
We got a canoe.
我們有一艘獨木舟

165
00:11:29,32 --> 00:11:31,55
I don't think we need a canoe.
我們不需要獨木舟

166
00:11:31,82 --> 00:11:33,05
You got to take it.
你們一定要收下獨木舟

167
00:11:36,76 --> 00:11:39,02
Just take the entertainment center.
你們就把櫃子搬走吧

168
00:11:39,26 --> 00:11:42,09
Then when you get home, throw the canoe away.
等你們到家，再把獨木舟扔掉

169
00:11:42,43 --> 00:11:45,37
We're not throwing it away. I built it.
想都別想，那是我親手造的

170
00:11:46,60 --> 00:11:47,76
Good for you!
幹得好！

171
00:11:51,07 --> 00:11:53,17
（中央咖啡館）

172
00:11:53,77 --> 00:11:57,40
You won't believe what I found on a telephone pole.
你們看我在電線桿上發現什麼

173
00:11:57,71 --> 00:11:58,84
Look familiar?
眼熟嗎？

174
00:11:59,11 --> 00:12:03,28
Apparently Phoebe's mother also goes by the name "Julio."
顯然菲比的母親也叫胡立歐

175
00:12:04,95 --> 00:12:09,05
Wait a minute. This is not the same cat. This cat's only this big.
不一樣吧，這只只有這麼大

176
00:12:10,76 --> 00:12:14,25
A little girl's looking for this cat. Know what that means?
有個小女孩在找這隻貓 知道這代表什麼嗎？

177
00:12:14,53 --> 00:12:17,36
Yeah! $200 reward split five ways!
知道，五個人平分2百元賞金

178
00:12:20,07 --> 00:12:22,16
Do we have to tell her?
要告訴她嗎？

179
00:12:22,44 --> 00:12:25,60
-Yes,we do. -But it's made her so happy.
當然要告訴她 但她現在好開心

180
00:12:26,51 --> 00:12:28,70
Little girl misses her cat.
想念貓咪的小女孩

181
00:12:28,91 --> 00:12:32,94
Crazy lady thinks her mother is in a cat.
覺得貓是母親轉世的瘋婆子

182
00:12:33,25 --> 00:12:36,08
I have to go have dinner with my son.
好，我要去跟我兒子吃飯

183
00:12:36,28 --> 00:12:39,68
Can I trust that when you see Phoebe, you will tell her?
你們見到菲比會告訴她吧？

184
00:12:39,75 --> 00:12:40,82
會

185
00:12:41,42 --> 00:12:43,08
Thank you.
謝謝

186
00:12:45,06 --> 00:12:47,25
I hate when Ross is right.
我最討厭羅斯說對了

187
00:12:47,53 --> 00:12:48,69
He is right,isn't he?
他說得對，對吧？

188
00:12:48,93 --> 00:12:51,66
This might be one time when he's wrong.
搞不好這一次他錯了

189
00:12:51,80 --> 00:12:54,79
-You think? -Oh,no. He's right.
是嗎？ 不，他說得對

191
00:13:07,85 --> 00:13:09,41
About your mom.
菲比，關於你的母親… 怎樣？

192
00:13:13,15 --> 00:13:15,15
How's that going?
你們處得好嗎？

193
00:13:15,42 --> 00:13:18,32
So great. We took a nap together today.
棒呆了，我們今天一起睡午覺

194
00:13:18,56 --> 00:13:20,99
Mom fell asleep on my tummy and purred.
媽在我肚子上睡著還打呼

195
00:13:23,36 --> 00:13:24,99
That's so sweet.
真溫馨

196
00:13:27,67 --> 00:13:29,23
I'm gonna get some coffee.
我去點咖啡

197
00:13:35,58 --> 00:13:38,44
What'd you say,Joe? I'll be right there.
喬伊你說什麼？我馬上過去

198
00:13:43,68 --> 00:13:45,45
I just feel so....
菲比 我覺得好…

199
00:13:45,69 --> 00:13:47,85
-All right! -I'm coming already!
知道了啦 馬上來

200
00:13:54,56 --> 00:13:57,12
Not yet,not yet,not yet!
還沒還沒還沒…

201
00:14:03,27 --> 00:14:05,03
-Hello,Chip. -How you doing?
奇普 瑞秋，你好嗎？

202
00:14:05,27 --> 00:14:06,60
I'm great!
很好

203
00:14:06,81 --> 00:14:09,87
Got a great job. I have wonderful friends.
我有一份好工作，一群好朋友

204
00:14:10,08 --> 00:14:14,91
Though I'm not seeing anyone now, I've never felt better about myself.
雖然現在沒有男朋友 卻對自己很滿意

205
00:14:17,22 --> 00:14:18,78
So,Monica ready yet?
摩妮卡好了嗎？

206
00:14:22,22 --> 00:14:23,99
She'll be out in a second.
她馬上就好

207
00:14:24,29 --> 00:14:27,49
So,Chip,how's Amy Welsh?
奇普，艾美威許好嗎？

208
00:14:27,73 --> 00:14:30,79
Amy Welsh? I haven't seen her since
艾美威許？我們自從…

209
00:14:33,13 --> 00:14:36,07
So,Monica about ready?
摩妮卡快好了嗎？

210
00:14:38,01 --> 00:14:40,60
-Wow,you look great. -Thanks.
你好漂亮 謝謝

211
00:14:40,74 --> 00:14:43,23
-Well,you guys have fun. -Catch you later.
好好去玩吧 再聯絡 

212
00:14:43,38 --> 00:14:45,28
Bye,Chip.
奇普再見

213
00:14:46,05 --> 00:14:48,21
-Are you sure you're okay about this? -Actually
你真的不在意？ 其實…

214
00:14:48,38 --> 00:14:50,58
Okay,great.
太好了

215
00:14:53,09 --> 00:14:55,18
This is the unit for you.
買這個櫃子就對了

216
00:14:55,42 --> 00:14:58,19
Sturdy construction, tons of storage.
堅固耐用，容量超大

217
00:14:58,46 --> 00:15:00,86
Some big enough to fit a grown man.
甚至塞得進一個大人

218
00:15:01,90 --> 00:15:05,46
-What? -Yeah,I got in there myself once.
什麼？ 對，我就進去過一次

219
00:15:05,77 --> 00:15:07,89
My roommate bet me $5 I couldn't.
我的室友賭5元說我進不去

220
00:15:08,14 --> 00:15:11,80
Then he stuck a board through the handles and locked me in.
然後在門把上塞棍子把我關住

221
00:15:12,54 --> 00:15:15,57
It was funny till I felt like it was a coffin.
起先很好玩，後來感覺像棺材

222
00:15:17,65 --> 00:15:21,05
No,you can't fit in there. It's not deep enough.
你才進不去，它不夠深

223
00:15:21,55 --> 00:15:23,41
Oh,yeah?
是嗎？

224
00:15:24,59 --> 00:15:26,08
If I can't...
要是我進不去…

225
00:15:26,62 --> 00:15:29,11
...I'll knock $5 off the price.
就少算你5塊錢

226
00:15:29,56 --> 00:15:31,68
All right,you have yourself a deal.
就這麼說定 好

227
00:15:36,40 --> 00:15:38,42
See? I told you.
你看，我就說吧

228
00:15:41,64 --> 00:15:44,73
Sometimes I come in here just to get away from it.
有時我會進進出出的玩

229
00:15:46,94 --> 00:15:48,31
Hey,a nickel!
有5分錢

230
00:15:53,31 --> 00:15:54,30
Here we are.
到了

231
00:15:54,58 --> 00:15:56,61
You still have the Chipper!
天哪，你的奇車還在

232
00:15:56,88 --> 00:15:58,04
The what?
什麼？

233
00:15:58,55 --> 00:16:02,22
That's what we called your motorcycle in high school.
那是你的車子在高中的外號

234
00:16:02,46 --> 00:16:04,12
A motorcycle's a chopper.
摩托車也叫機車

235
00:16:04,39 --> 00:16:06,42
And you're Chip.
而你叫奇普

236
00:16:06,73 --> 00:16:08,09
Never mind.
沒事

237
00:16:09,16 --> 00:16:10,79
I think it's cute.
真可愛

238
00:16:16,27 --> 00:16:18,43
A lipper from Chipper.
奇普親親

239
00:16:20,51 --> 00:16:22,77
Are you still in touch with anyone?
你還有跟哪些同學聯絡？

240
00:16:23,01 --> 00:16:25,00
There's Rachel...
有瑞秋，還有…

241
00:16:26,01 --> 00:16:28,14
...and that's it. How about you?
就這樣，你呢？

242
00:16:28,42 --> 00:16:33,48
I still hang with Simens and Zana. I see Spindler,Levine,Kelly.
我還在跟西門斯、薩納混 也常跟史賓、萊文、凱利見面

243
00:16:33,69 --> 00:16:35,68
I run into Goldie...
三不五時會遇見高第

244
00:16:35,99 --> 00:16:38,39
...Stick,Brown,Sulkov,McGuire...
史迪、布朗、蘇卡夫、麥奎爾

245
00:16:38,66 --> 00:16:40,85
...J.T.,Beardsley.
傑弟、畢斯利

246
00:16:41,43 --> 00:16:42,42
Is that all?
就這樣？

247
00:16:42,70 --> 00:16:45,86
After high school, you kind of lose touch.
畢了業都會失去聯絡

248
00:16:47,20 --> 00:16:49,00
I ran into Richard Dorfman.
我有遇見李察多夫曼

249
00:16:49,27 --> 00:16:52,33
-How is he? -Me and Simens gave him a wedgie.
他好嗎？ 不太好，被我和西門斯敲竹槓

250
00:16:54,61 --> 00:16:56,01
Isn't he an architect?
他不是建築師嗎？

251
00:16:56,24 --> 00:16:57,94
They still wear underwear.
建築師也要穿內褲

252
00:17:11,19 --> 00:17:12,39
Oh,my God!
天哪！

253
00:17:14,70 --> 00:17:15,68
What?
怎麼了？

254
00:17:18,60 --> 00:17:20,46
Are you all right?
你還好嗎？ 還好

255
00:17:22,87 --> 00:17:24,30
What happened?
怎麼回事？

256
00:17:24,97 --> 00:17:28,97
Oh,man,he promised he wouldn't take the chairs!
他答應不拿沙發椅的

257
00:17:29,21 --> 00:17:33,94
How were you locked in? Where the hell is all of our stuff?
你怎麼會被關進去？ 我們的東西呢？

258
00:17:34,31 --> 00:17:36,65
This guy came by to look at the unit...
有一個人來看櫃子

259
00:17:36,95 --> 00:17:39,44
...and he said it won't fit a grown man.
他說它塞不下一個大人

260
00:17:40,32 --> 00:17:42,72
So you got in voluntarily?
所以你自願進去？

261
00:17:42,96 --> 00:17:45,58
I was trying to make a sale!
我想把櫃子賣出去

262
00:17:45,83 --> 00:17:49,09
If I ever run into him, you know what I'll do?
要是讓我碰上他 你猜我會怎樣？

263
00:17:49,33 --> 00:17:50,96
Bend over?
把屁股翹起來？

264
00:17:55,74 --> 00:17:59,50
And then Zana just let one rip!
薩納乾脆讓另一個破掉

265
00:18:03,91 --> 00:18:07,35
Not that I don't enjoy talking about high school...
我不是不喜歡回憶往事

266
00:18:07,61 --> 00:18:09,48
...because I do.
我喜歡

267
00:18:09,85 --> 00:18:12,01
Maybe we can talk about something else.
但我們可以聊點別的

268
00:18:12,29 --> 00:18:14,62
I don't know where you work.
像你，我還不曉得你的工作

269
00:18:14,92 --> 00:18:17,29
-You know where I work. -I do?
你知道啊 我知道？

270
00:18:17,52 --> 00:18:20,98
The movie theater. You used to come in all the time.
電影院啊，你以前常來

271
00:18:21,43 --> 00:18:22,86
Still at the Multiplex?
你還在影城做事？

272
00:18:23,13 --> 00:18:25,43
Like I'd give up that job!
我怎麼可能換工作

273
00:18:26,30 --> 00:18:28,86
Free popcorn and candy anytime I want?
隨時都有爆米花和糖果可吃

274
00:18:29,10 --> 00:18:30,43
I can get you posters.
我可以幫你拿海報

275
00:18:30,67 --> 00:18:31,93
Thanks,I'm set.
謝謝，不用了

276
00:18:33,57 --> 00:18:35,87
Oh,you know who came in the other night? Peters.
你猜那天誰來了？彼得斯

277
00:18:36,01 --> 00:18:40,17
Told me he just went out with Leslie Maskin. Got to third base.
他說他剛才跟女朋友上了三壘

278
00:18:44,65 --> 00:18:46,24
Do you still live with your parents?
你還住在家裡？

279
00:18:46,49 --> 00:18:49,58
Yeah,but I can stay out as late as I want.
對，但是沒有門禁

280
00:18:55,16 --> 00:19:00,03
You know,with all of our stuff gone, the unit doesn't seem that big.
少了別的東西 櫃子就沒那麼大了

281
00:19:00,90 --> 00:19:03,67
Why couldn't he have been a kidnapper.
那個人怎麼不是綁匪？

282
00:19:05,21 --> 00:19:08,83
They really got you guys. Your TV,the chairs.
他們還真是大搬家 電視、沙發椅

283
00:19:09,04 --> 00:19:11,84
Your microwave,the stereo.
微波爐、音響

284
00:19:12,21 --> 00:19:15,51
Man,he took the five of spades!
天哪，他把黑桃5拿走了

285
00:19:16,45 --> 00:19:18,54
No,here it is.
在這裡

286
00:19:20,45 --> 00:19:22,39
Oh,my God! What happened?
天哪！怎麼了？

287
00:19:22,62 --> 00:19:26,56
Joey was born,and then 28 years later, I was robbed!
喬伊出生 28年後，我被搶了

288
00:19:30,63 --> 00:19:32,46
So how was your date?
怎麼樣？

289
00:19:32,70 --> 00:19:36,03
Well,I always wanted to go out with Chip in high school.
我高中時一直想跟奇普約會

290
00:19:36,30 --> 00:19:40,33
Tonight,I actually went out with Chip in high school.
今晚 我真的跟高中的奇普約會了

291
00:19:41,31 --> 00:19:42,83
Honey,I'm sorry.
真可惜

292
00:19:43,14 --> 00:19:46,04
Not only did I get to go out with Chip...
不會，我不但跟奇普約了會

293
00:19:46,28 --> 00:19:48,08
...I got to dump Chip.
我還甩了他

294
00:19:48,22 --> 00:19:51,38
-That's so great! -I know.
太棒了 我知道

295
00:19:54,02 --> 00:19:56,05
What did the insurance company say?
保險公司怎麼說？

296
00:19:56,29 --> 00:20:00,23
They said,"You don't have insurance. Stop calling us."
他們說 「你們沒投保，別再打來了」

297
00:20:04,16 --> 00:20:05,63
You didn't tell her?
你們沒有告訴她？

298
00:20:09,47 --> 00:20:10,70
Okay,fine.
好吧

299
00:20:12,27 --> 00:20:13,26
菲比

300
00:20:14,98 --> 00:20:16,20
Listen...
聽我說

301
00:20:17,34 --> 00:20:20,40
...this cat belongs to a little girl.
這隻貓是一個小女孩的

302
00:20:20,71 --> 00:20:23,88
There are flyers all over the place.
路上帖滿了尋貓啟事

303
00:20:24,15 --> 00:20:26,42
I'm sorry,sweetie.
對不起

304
00:20:26,75 --> 00:20:29,48
We can take her back with you if you want.
我們可以陪你把貓送回去

305
00:20:33,49 --> 00:20:36,69
But,you know,she chose to find me.
但是她選擇來找我

306
00:20:37,20 --> 00:20:39,53
I have to respect her decision,right?
我得尊重她的決定，對吧？

307
00:20:41,34 --> 00:20:43,86
-That's a good call. -That's right.
有道理 沒錯

308
00:20:45,17 --> 00:20:46,40
Enough is enough.
不對，別再鬧了

309
00:20:46,67 --> 00:20:50,94
I'm sorry you feel guilty about spending time with your new mom.
我很遺憾你跟新媽媽在一起 會有罪惡感

310
00:20:51,21 --> 00:20:52,87
But this isn't your old mom.
但這不是你的舊媽媽

311
00:20:53,18 --> 00:20:54,55
This is a cat.
這是一隻貓

312
00:20:54,78 --> 00:20:57,01
Julio the cat.
它叫胡立歐

313
00:20:57,55 --> 00:20:59,38
Not Mom! Cat.
不是媽媽，是貓

314
00:21:08,36 --> 00:21:11,02
Ross,how many parents have you lost?
羅斯，你失去過幾個父母？

315
00:21:12,20 --> 00:21:13,60
None.
零個

316
00:21:13,73 --> 00:21:17,36
Then you don't know how it feels when one of them comes back.
那你就無法體會 其中一個回來的感覺，對吧？

317
00:21:21,94 --> 00:21:24,04
I believe this is my mother.
我相信這是我的母親

318
00:21:24,28 --> 00:21:26,47
Even if I'm wrong,who cares?
就算不是又怎樣？

319
00:21:26,88 --> 00:21:29,78
Just be a friend,okay? Be supportive.
你就當個好朋友，支持我

320
00:21:33,72 --> 00:21:35,71
I'm sorry.
對不起 

321
00:21:35,96 --> 00:21:37,48
Okay.
好

322
00:21:39,16 --> 00:21:41,15
I don't know what to say.
我不知道該說什麼

323
00:21:43,86 --> 00:21:45,33
You could say...
你可以...

324
00:21:45,53 --> 00:21:47,83
...you're sorry to her mom.
...向她的媽媽道歉

325
00:21:54,57 --> 00:21:56,37
I think she would like that.
我想她會接受

326
00:22:07,69 --> 00:22:09,62
Come here. Here,come here.
乖，過來

327
00:22:12,59 --> 00:22:14,42
Mrs. Buffay?
布非太太？

328
00:22:17,40 --> 00:22:19,89
Sorry about what I said.
我為我說的話道歉

329
00:22:20,10 --> 00:22:23,26
It was insensitive of me to say...
我實在很傷人

330
00:22:23,54 --> 00:22:26,06
...that you were just a cat...
說你只是一隻貓

331
00:22:28,24 --> 00:22:30,07
...when,clearly,you are also...
很顯然的，你也是…

332
00:22:30,28 --> 00:22:32,91
...the reincarnated spirit...
我朋友的母親…

333
00:22:34,08 --> 00:22:35,98
...of my friend's mother.
靈魂轉世

334
00:22:38,25 --> 00:22:39,41
Thank you.
謝謝你

335
00:22:40,49 --> 00:22:42,48
We both forgive you.
我們都原諒你

336
00:22:44,26 --> 00:22:46,99
What will you do about the little girl?
那個小女孩怎麼辦？

338
00:22:48,16 --> 00:22:49,32
Listen.
好，聽我說

339
00:22:50,56 --> 00:22:53,59
Mom,I hope you know you still mean a lot to me.
媽，你對我還是很重要

340
00:22:53,80 --> 00:22:56,36
You're welcome to come back anytime.
你隨時都可以回來

341
00:22:58,37 --> 00:23:02,00
If she'd come back as a couch, we'd really appreciate it.
要是她可以變成一張沙發 我們會很感激

343
00:23:03,88 --> 00:23:05,54
Come on. I'll take you home.
走吧，我帶你回家

344
00:23:05,71 --> 00:23:07,77
-I'll go with you. -Me too.
我跟你去 我也去

345
00:23:09,92 --> 00:23:11,78
I got an extra futon.
我有多的蒲團

346
00:23:12,32 --> 00:23:15,88
Dude,you don't have to brag. We got nothing here.
你拽個屁啊，我們什麼都沒有

347
00:23:20,06 --> 00:23:21,99
謹此紀念桃樂絲考夫曼

348
00:23:49,86 --> 00:23:51,76
You know....
說真的…

349
00:23:53,29 --> 00:23:55,69
It's peaceful out here.
這裡真幽靜

350
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


351
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


